# The README animation, as a script.
#
#   scripts/record-demo.sh "C:/Program Files/7-Zip/7z.dll"
#
# One frame per key press, plus explicit holds, so the pacing lives here
# instead of in a capture. See src/tui/record.rs for the command reference.

size 110 30

# ── the intro, while the engine recovers functions ──
splash 24
hold 8

# ── the function list ──
# 6472 of them in a stripped C++ parser, seeded from the exception directory
key down 12
hold 12

# ── the ranked attack surface ──
# the sink call sites the audit thinks are worst, with the evidence for each
key s
hold 22
key down 2
hold 18
key down 1
hold 20

# ── follow one into the code ──
key enter
hold 20

# ── and read it as pseudocode ──
key d
hold 30
key down 10
hold 20

# ── the control-flow graph ──
key f
hold 16
key down 2
hold 8
key right
hold 10
key down 1
hold 18

# back to the listing it came from
key f
hold 14
